Model Name

Arabic Cybercrime Complaints RAG Chatbot

2. Objective

Develop an Arabic-first RAG chatbot specialized in receiving cybercrime complaints through a normal conversational chat interface, collecting incident details, assessing severity, and providing safe, accurate guidance.

The system stores structured complaint reports for administrators as PDF documents, while end-users interact only via natural Arabic chat (no JSON exposure).

