8. Arabic Text Processing (Mandatory)
8.1 Query & Document Preprocessing

Arabic normalization must be applied before embedding and retrieval.

Steps

توحيد الألفات (أ / إ / آ → ا)

توحيد الياء (ى → ي)

إزالة التشكيل غير الضروري

إزالة المدود والرموز الزائدة

Purpose
Ensure semantic consistency so that:

"إختراق"

"اختراق"

"اختراقُ"

are treated identically during retrieval.

9. Document Processing (Arabic PDF Handling)
Challenge

Arabic PDFs often contain:

Broken characters

Incorrect RTL order

Fragmented words

Recommended Solution

Do NOT rely on PyPDF2 alone.

Preferred Stack

pdfplumber → primary extractor (RTL-aware)

Marker → complex or scanned PDFs (optional)

PyPDF2 → fallback only

Rules

Preserve right-to-left reading order

Validate extracted text

Apply Arabic normalization before embedding

